{"id":"a2bb3e5ff2690991","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-top4-covering-dimension-zero.md","title":"ZFC Top4 Covering Dimension Zero","display":"df-zfc-top4-covering-dimension-zero — ZFC Top4 Covering Dimension Zero","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top4-covering-dimension-zero","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top4-covering-dimension-zero"],"display":"df-zfc-top4-covering-dimension-zero — ZFC Top4 Covering Dimension Zero","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-top4-refinement-of-cover]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top4-covering-dimension-zero"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top4-covering-dimension-zero</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top4-covering-dimension-zero — ZFC Top4 Covering Dimension Zero"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ccce769ac62de4b\" href=\"?note=7ccce769ac62de4b\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-top4-refinement-of-cover\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-top4-refinement-of-cover</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite\">../batch04/58-df-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (carrier set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> (topology candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V\\)</span> (finite open-family candidates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RefinementOfCover}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RefinementOfCover}_S\\)</span> (cover-refinement predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7ccce769ac62de4b\" href=\"?note=7ccce769ac62de4b\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-top4-refinement-of-cover\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-top4-refinement-of-cover</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite\">../batch04/58-df-finite</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4CoveringDimensionZero}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4CoveringDimensionZero}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}covering\\text{-}dimension\\text{-}zero}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4CoveringDimensionZero}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal U)\\land X=\\bigcup\\mathcal U\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal V)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RefinementOfCover}_S(X,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V)\n\\land\n\\forall V,W\\in\\mathcal V\\;\n(V\\neq W\\to V\\cap W=\\varnothing)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}covering\\text{-}dimension\\text{-}zero}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4CoveringDimensionZero}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal U)\\land X=\\bigcup\\mathcal U\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal V)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RefinementOfCover}_S(X,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V)\n\\land\n\\forall V,W\\in\\mathcal V\\;\n(V\\neq W\\to V\\cap W=\\varnothing)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Covering dimension zero requires disjoint refinements of finite open covers; quantifying all covers would instead impose the stronger ultraparacompactness condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-top4-refinement-of-cover","status":"resolved","id":"7ccce769ac62de4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-top4-refinement-of-cover]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-top4-refinement-of-cover","status":"resolved","id":"7ccce769ac62de4b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RefinementOfCover}_S$ (cover-refinement predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-top4-refinement-of-cover]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}$ (finite-set predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-finite]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RefinementOfCover}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4CoveringDimensionZero}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}covering\\text{-}dimension\\text{-}zero}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4CoveringDimensionZero}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal U)\\land X=\\bigcup\\mathcal U\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\\\\n&\\qquad\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal V)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RefinementOfCover}_S(X,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V)\n\\land\n\\forall V,W\\in\\mathcal V\\;\n(V\\neq W\\to V\\cap W=\\varnothing)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1782,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3568","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-top4-covering-dimension-zero.md|58-df-zfc-top4-covering-dimension-zero]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","7ccce769ac62de4b","74086485fba8d86f","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}